      MaskType      "SpeedController (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "2DOF PI speed controller (SpeedController). The inputs are the standby of the control system, the speed estimate fbk.w_M, the limited torque reference ref.tau_M (anti-windup), and the speed reference w_M_ref, and the output is the torque reference. In standby (the input standby nonzero), the torque reference is zero and the controller is not updated, as in VectorControlSystem."
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
