      MaskType      "CurrentVectorController (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Current-vector controller (CurrentVectorController). The configuration cfg is a struct with the fields of CurrentVectorControllerCfg ([] = None, i.e., the default; the default observer gain k_o only). The mask initialization resolves the defaults and passes the parameters to the blocks inside it, as CurrentVectorController. The inputs u_c_lim_ab (the limited voltage reference of the PWM) and enable (the gate enable) are used by the direct discrete-time current controller. The machine model par is a struct with the fields n_p, R_s, R_R, L_sgm, and L_M of InductionMachineInvGammaPars."
      MaskInit      "% Default of alpha_i (CurrentController.__init__)\nalpha_i = cfg.alpha_i;\nif isempty(alpha_i)\n  alpha_i = cfg.alpha_c;\nend\n"
