    Component {
      Type          Subsystem
      Name          "CurrentController"
      Show          on
      Position      [685, 95]
      Direction     up
      Flipped       off
      LabelPosition south
      Frame         [-50, -30; 50, 30]
      SampleTime    "-1"
      CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
      CodeGenTarget "Generic"
      MaskType      "CurrentController (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Current controller: the 2DOF PI controller (CurrentController) or, if discrete = 1, the direct discrete-time controller of the leakage flux linkages L_sgm*i (DiscreteCurrentController). The inputs are the current reference, the feedback signals fbk (the current fbk.i_s, and the realized voltage fbk.u_s and the angular speed fbk.w_c of the coordinates for the update), and for the update of the discrete-time controller, the limited voltage reference u_c_lim_ab of the PWM in stationary coordinates, used while the gates are enabled (the input enable nonzero), as in CurrentVectorController.update. The output is the voltage reference. The machine model par is a struct with the fields n_p, R_s, R_R, L_sgm, and L_M of InductionMachineInvGammaPars."
      MaskInit      "% Fields of the machine model par (InductionMachineInvGammaPars) for the\n% C-Script\npar_n_p = par.n_p;\npar_R_s = par.R_s;\npar_R_R = par.R_R;\npar_L_sgm = par.L_sgm;\npar_L_M = par.L_M;\n"
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
        Variable      "par"
        Prompt        "par: Machine model (InductionMachineInvGammaPars) as a struct"
        Type          FreeText
        Value         "par"
        Show          off
        Tunable       on
        TabName       ""
      }
      Parameter {
