      MaskType      "FluxTorqueController (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Flux and torque controller (FluxTorqueController) without the integral action. The input ref is [psi_s tau_M], the flux and torque references, and the output is the stator voltage reference. The machine model par is a struct with the fields n_p, R_s, R_R, L_sgm, and L_M of InductionMachineInvGammaPars. L_M = inf in pure open-loop V/Hz control."
      MaskInit      "% Fields of the machine model par (InductionMachineInvGammaPars) for the\n% C-Script\npar_n_p = par.n_p;\npar_R_s = par.R_s;\npar_R_R = par.R_R;\npar_L_sgm = par.L_sgm;\npar_L_M = par.L_M;\n"
