      Frame         [-50, -50; 50, 50]
      SampleTime    "-1"
      CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
      CodeGenTarget "Generic"
      MaskType      "PWM (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Space-vector PWM with the minimum-phase-error (MPE) or the minimum-magnitude-error (MME) overmodulation (PWM), with the duty-ratio error model d_err = InverterNonlinearity(t_d, u_th, sign) and its compensation, the minimum pulses, and the single update. The blocks inside are its methods compute_output and get_realized_voltage. While the gates are blocked (the input enable is zero), the realized voltage is the measured PCC voltage, as in get_feedback of the control system."
      MaskInit      "% MME overmodulation, or MPE\nmme = strcmp(overmodulation, 'MME');\n"
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
