      MaskType      "PLL (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Phase-locked loop with the filtered PCC voltage magnitude (PLL), giving the feedback signals fbk in its coordinates from the measurements. The output fbk.u_c is the realized converter voltage u_c_ab averaged over the previous and ongoing periods (GridConverterControlSystem.get_feedback)."
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
        Variable      "u_nom"
        Prompt        "u_nom: Nominal grid voltage (V), line-to-neutral peak value"
        Type          FreeText
